  "limits": "Class I subdivision with the vertex-up orientation only; other classes, orientations and truncations (such as 5/8 domes) are not available. Odd frequencies end in a stepped rim. Struts are straight hexagonal prisms that overlap the hubs; connector design, panel joints and loads are not modelled. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
